  * Read-only file browsing through vboximg-mount.
  * Golden image workflow: multiattach base attached to several VMs.
  * Opt-in trash purge by age or total size; the newest delete is kept.
  * Undo last change for Move, Resolve re-point and Properties edits.
  * Match media library entries by file rather than path spelling.
  * Ship an application icon; build Windows and macOS binaries in CI.

