vboxfront (1.10.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Split the application into vboxfront_app modules for domain logic,
    commands, persistence, services, process runners, widgets and dialogs.
    Keep vboxfront.py as the entry point and compatibility import facade;
    update PyInstaller, Debian staleness checks and the E2E Docker inputs.
  * Preserve overwrite targets until clone/import/export succeeds. Restore
    the named backing file on failure and retain partial output for inspection.
    Add persistent operation recovery records and exclusive target leases.
    In-place --existing clones and multi-file companions have no rollback.
  * Add a trash manager with logical/allocated sizes, selected restore and
    confirmed permanent deletion. Persist delete batches across restarts.
  * Measure compressed RAW archives on a cancellable worker and cache results
    while the source is unchanged. Never trust gzip trailer lengths: wrapped
    and concatenated members require full measurement or a known exact size.
  * Add VM/controller/slot storage views with attach/detach actions, read-only
    registry snapshot comparisons, and named saved filters.
  * Show succeeded, failed and skipped batch commands with confirmed retry
    of selected failures. Preserve preparation and per-command follow-ups.
  * Fix premature batch target deletion, missing overwrite preparation in plan
    mode, registered-image overwrite gaps, stream/decompression error handling,
    crash exit status handling and pending commands during application close.
  * Refresh documentation and ignore rules for generated bytecode, build
    artifacts, trash directories, recovery backups and partial output.

